      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLASSY HUNTER (2) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this trip which boasts four wins and four placings. Placed last time (41.92) at this track in a OPEN, finishing second and beaten 7 lengths. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. POSITIVE PENNY (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (42.33) in a Grade 5/6 at this track. One of the better hopes. BARTLETT (5) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage second, beaten 3.5 lengths (41.58) at this track in a Grade 5/6 over 710m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expecting another good run. URANA SPACE (8) was in the money last start and poses a threat again.",
